BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:liv-team-championship-2026-d1@claude-liv-cal
DTSTAMP:20260727T090000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260827
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260828
SUMMARY:⛳ Aramco LIV Golf Michigan Team Championship
LOCATION:The Cardinal at Saint John's\, 44045 Five Mile Rd\, Plymouth\, M
 I 48170\, USA
GEO:42.393536;-83.478617
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="44045 Five Mile Rd, Plym
 outh, MI 48170, USA";X-APPLE-RADIUS=150;X-TITLE="The Cardinal at Saint J
 ohn's":geo:42.393536,-83.478617
DESCRIPTION:Round 1 - Thursday 27 August 2026\n\nVenue: The Cardinal at S
 aint John's\nAddress: 44045 Five Mile Rd\, Plymouth\, MI 48170\, USA\nTo
 urnament dates: Thu 27 Aug - Sun 30 Aug 2026\nPurse: $25M individual + $
 5M team (approx.)\nEvent type: LIV Golf - Team Championship\n\nNotes\n**
 * EXPECTED TO BE CANCELLED - STILL OFFICIALLY ON ***\n\nStatus at 31 Jul
 y 2026: LIV has DELAYED any announcement and said nothing this week\, so
  the event technically remains on the schedule. But Front Office Sports 
 and multiple outlets report\, from sources\, that it will be cancelled. 
 No tournament infrastructure or fan hospitality has been built at the ve
 nue\, contractors say travel was cancelled with money still owed\, and t
 he championship rings reportedly remain unpaid for.\n\nWhy the delay: LI
 V is mid-negotiation with potential backers after the Saudi PIF said in 
 April it would stop funding the league. It reportedly holds multiple wri
 tten commitments from blue-chip firms willing to act as anchor investors
 \, and is weighing options for what it internally calls LIV 2.0. The wor
 king deadline for new funding is around 1 September.\n\nIf it goes\, ele
 ments of the team championship may be folded into Indianapolis instead. 
 That would leave LIV with 12 events this season rather than 14 - Louisia
 na was already cancelled in April.\n\nAs scheduled: $40m purse (down fro
 m $50m)\, $11.2m to the winning team\, at The Cardinal at Saint John's.\
 n\nTee times confirmed the week of the event - livgolf.com/schedule\n
CATEGORIES:LIV Golf,LIV Golf - Team Championship
URL:https://www.livgolf.com/schedule
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:TENTATIVE
END:VEVENT
